	(text "CustomFOCBoard - 2-layer motor module (DRV8316C + STM32G431 + MT6701)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b30b2abf-6476-49cc-8c72-dd731d1fdbda")
	)
	(text "POWER: VM 4.5-32 V on solder pads J6(+)/J7(-) or bus connectors J1/J2. Limits: AP63203 32 V, DRV8316 35 V.\n  NO reverse-polarity protection - check the wires before power-up. USB alone powers the logic via D2.\nDRV8316 straps: MODE 47k->AVDD = 3x PWM (INLx = phase enable, DRV_EN). SLEW open (Hi-Z) = 50 V/us (AVDD would be 200). OCP/SR->GND.\n  VSEL_BK->GND, buck in resistor mode (R6/C14): unused, but TI says it must be populated.\n  VREF = AVDD (3.3 V) -> SOx = 1.65 V +/- GAIN x I.  C10 (CP) goes to VM, not GND.\n  GAIN: R4 0R->AVDD = 1.2 V/A (fitted).  R5 0R->GND = 0.15 V/A.  Both open = 0.3 V/A.  47k->AVDD = 0.6 V/A.\nSTM32 pins: PWM TIM1 CH1-3 = PA8/PA9/PA10.  ISENSE A/B/C = PA0/PA1/PA2 (ADC1 IN1-3).  VSENSE = PA3 (VM/11).\n  NTC = PB0.  DRV_EN = PB10.  nSLEEP = PB2.  nFAULT = PB12.  LED = PB6.  USB = PA11/PA12.  SWD = PA13/PA14.\n  Encoder SSI on SPI1: CLK PB3, DO PB4 (MISO), CS PA15.  MT6701 MODE high = I2C/SSI (low = ABZ).\n  CAN = FDCAN1 PB9 (TX) / PB8 (RX).  PB8 is also BOOT0 and CAN RX idles high: flash over SWD first,\n  then set the BOOT0 option bytes (nSWBOOT0/nBOOT0, see RM0440) so the chip boots from flash.\nCrystal load caps C26/C27 assume a ~12 pF crystal; adjust to the part you buy."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f684672-7ec2-486a-bdc7-57e625347db5")
	)
